---

  <section class="section appear" id="contract">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="no">03</span>
      <h2>The contract, on paper.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="contract">
      <div class="left">
        <h3>Rendered into your repo</h3>
        <p>Files jig writes and maintains. Everything outside this list stays repo-owned.</p>
<pre class="tree">
<b>target-repo/</b>
├── <i>.jig.toml</i>            <span class="tic">— public config + renderer answers</span>
├── <i>AGENTS.md</i>            <span class="tic">— managed block; rest is yours</span>
├── <i>agent-map.md</i>         <span class="tic">— surface area, in plain text</span>
├── <s>.agent/</s>
│   ├── <i>jig-contract.json</i><span class="tic">— machine-readable surface</span>
│   └── <s>state/</s>            <span class="tic">— append-only run history (JSONL)</span>
├── <s>scripts/</s>
│   ├── <u>jig</u>              <span class="tic">— launcher; checks contract + profile</span>
│   ├── <u>install-jig.sh</u>
│   └── <u>enforce-coverage.cjs</u>
└── <s>.github/workflows/</s>
    ├── <u>agent-map-check.yml</u>
    ├── <u>repo-policy.yml</u>
    ├── <u>rust-tests.yml</u>
    └── <u>webapp-checks.yml</u>
</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="right" id="receipts">
        <h3>What an agent leaves behind</h3>
        <p>Run events and target results in <span class="hot">.agent/state/runs.jsonl</span>. Reviewable. Diffable. Auditable. Loop occurrence evidence lives outside the checkout under Git metadata.</p>

        <div class="receipts">
          <div class="receipt ok">
            <span class="ts">10:42:11</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="y">api:fmt</span> · ok · <span class="d">cargo fmt --check</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt ok">
            <span class="ts">10:42:14</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="y">api:clippy</span> · ok · <span class="d">0 warnings, 0 errors</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt pend">
            <span class="ts">10:42:18</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="v">api:test</span> · started</span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt ok">
            <span class="ts">10:42:42</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="y">api:test</span> · ok · 184 passed · 12.4s</span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt fail">
            <span class="ts">10:43:01</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="x">web:test</span> · fail · coverage 71.8% (&lt; 80% threshold)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt pend">
            <span class="ts">10:43:09</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">run</span> · queued · <span class="d">web:test, repo:contract</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt ok">
            <span class="ts">10:44:02</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="y">web:test</span> · ok · coverage 83.2%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt ok">
            <span class="ts">10:44:11</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">target</span> · <span class="y">repo:contract</span> · ok</span>
          </div>
          <div class="receipt ok" style="margin-bottom:0;">
            <span class="ts">10:44:14</span>
            <span class="ev"><span class="k">run</span> · <span class="v">finished</span> · 2 targets · success</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
